      "samples": 219520,
      "sha256": "9f44ad009d249aac43da84960e5482148b6ad56f9e566ff9531d26436b6f87d4",
      "speaker_id": "1221",
      "split": "test-clean",
      "text": "THE CHILD HAD A NATIVE GRACE WHICH DOES NOT INVARIABLY CO EXIST WITH FAULTLESS BEAUTY ITS ATTIRE HOWEVER SIMPLE ALWAYS IMPRESSED THE BEHOLDER AS IF IT WERE THE VERY GARB THAT PRECISELY BECAME IT BEST",
      "utterance_id": "1221-135766-0003"
    },
    {
      "path": "/media/user/5bc0dc8d-c938-4b2a-af1b-94174fc511a9/datasets/revtrace/librispeech/LibriSpeech/test-clean/1221/135767/1221-135767-0004.flac",
      "sample_rate": 16000,
      "samples": 305440,
      "sha256": "b39853e9fbaeb7a8bcc2cbbaf3bff6650ed0838c609f614357228f16a879509d",
      "speaker_id": "1221",
      "split": "test-clean",
      "text": "WE HAVE SPOKEN OF PEARL'S RICH AND LUXURIANT BEAUTY A BEAUTY THAT SHONE WITH DEEP AND VIVID TINTS A BRIGHT COMPLEXION EYES POSSESSING INTENSITY BOTH OF DEPTH AND GLOW AND HAIR ALREADY OF A DEEP GLOSSY BROWN AND WHICH IN AFTER YEARS WOULD BE NEARLY AKIN TO BLACK",
      "utterance_id": "1221-135767-0004"
    },
    {
      "path": "/media/user/5bc0dc8d-c938-4b2a-af1b-94174fc511a9/datasets/revtrace/librispeech/LibriSpeech/test-clean/1284/1180/1284-1180-0004.flac",
