      "speaker_id": "1284",
      "split": "test-clean",
      "text": "A BED QUILT MADE OF PATCHES OF DIFFERENT KINDS AND COLORS OF CLOTH ALL NEATLY SEWED TOGETHER",
      "utterance_id": "1284-1180-0028"
    },
    {
      "path": "/media/user/5bc0dc8d-c938-4b2a-af1b-94174fc511a9/datasets/revtrace/librispeech/LibriSpeech/test-clean/1284/134647/1284-134647-0001.flac",
      "sample_rate": 16000,
      "samples": 164400,
      "sha256": "40c764345c38ef4cfa288fd2bc5566a2a36e4914f3f6e5cc172b63db02ae7799",
      "speaker_id": "1284",
      "split": "test-clean",
      "text": "THE EDICT OF MILAN THE GREAT CHARTER OF TOLERATION HAD CONFIRMED TO EACH INDIVIDUAL OF THE ROMAN WORLD THE PRIVILEGE OF CHOOSING AND PROFESSING HIS OWN RELIGION",
      "utterance_id": "1284-134647-0001"
    },
    {
      "path": "/media/user/5bc0dc8d-c938-4b2a-af1b-94174fc511a9/datasets/revtrace/librispeech/LibriSpeech/test-clean/1580/141083/1580-141083-0034.flac",
      "sample_rate": 16000,
      "samples": 111840,
      "sha256": "1fb8d31d2a742d6aa64f76da64e8d800ecf161541d47dc6a23d0ea4acb39d427",
      "speaker_id": "1580",
      "split": "test-clean",
      "text": "AS HOLMES DREW THE CURTAIN I WAS AWARE FROM SOME LITTLE RIGIDITY AND ALERTNESS OF HIS ATTITUDE THAT HE WAS PREPARED FOR AN EMERGENCY",
      "utterance_id": "1580-141083-0034"
    },
    {
      "path": "/media/user/5bc0dc8d-c938-4b2a-af1b-94174fc511a9/datasets/revtrace/librispeech/LibriSpeech/test-clean/1995/1837/1995-1837-0023.flac",
