      "speaker_id": "2094",
      "split": "test-clean",
      "text": "TO ALL APPEARANCE MOLLY HAD GOT THROUGH HER AFTER DINNER WORK IN AN EXEMPLARY MANNER HAD CLEANED HERSELF WITH GREAT DISPATCH AND NOW CAME TO ASK SUBMISSIVELY IF SHE SHOULD SIT DOWN TO HER SPINNING TILL MILKING TIME",
      "utterance_id": "2094-142345-0015"
    },
    {
      "path": "/media/user/5bc0dc8d-c938-4b2a-af1b-94174fc511a9/datasets/revtrace/librispeech/LibriSpeech/test-clean/2094/142345/2094-142345-0039.flac",
